	"Boa em quebrar. A Voz nunca me elogia por outra coisa.": "Good at breaking. The Voice never praises me for anything else.",
	"Boca Voraz": "Ravenous Maw",
	"Boceja, e quem respira o bocejo fica pesado.": "It yawns, and whoever breathes the yawn grows heavy.",
	"Bonito golpe. Eu teria aplaudido, se tivesse mãos.": "A fine blow. I would have applauded, if I had hands.",
	"Bonito. Ninguém te mandou carta nenhuma. Tens a mim.": "Lovely. No one sent you any letter. You have me.",
